[01:28.034](Wow) There's no limit to go
{"（哇）前方永无边界尽头"}
[01:35.819]Let me walk the right way
{"让我走上正确的道路"}
[01:38.452]We never know the truth of lies
{"我们永远无法知晓谎言的真相"}
[01:43.840]Everyone makes it a rule of white lies
{"每个人都把善意谎言当作准则"}
[01:49.229]Is that for me or for you
{"这是为我还是为你"}
[01:51.671]To keep from hurting our prides？
{"只为守护我们脆弱的自尊？"}
[01:54.782]If we could rid ourselves from vanities
{"若能摆脱虚荣的枷锁"}
[02:02.123]They pushed me out
{"他们将我排挤在外"}
[02:03.411]Then knocked me out
{"又把我击倒在地"}
[02:04.231]But smiled as if nothing was done
{"却笑得若无其事"}
[02:07.375]We did not see eye to eye
{"我们从未达成共识"}
[02:13.108]Their point of view is nothing new
{"他们的观点毫无新意"}
[02:15.724]We've been completely poles apart
